-- Each preset switches the ESP controls this script already has: Box (Full / Corners, with or without fill),
-- Skeleton, Role Flags, Outline, Full Body fill + strength, Style, Tracers, Arrows, Distance and Display Name.
-- The Pulse hub draws its own materials (Chrome, Lava, ...); here those names map to the closest fill / style mix.
