		Desc = "Classic: the shot is fired straight away (your normal Silent Aim). Flick Shot: your view flicks onto the murderer, the shot is fired, then the view returns (turns Silent Aim on, because the script has to fire the shot). Applies to Silent Aim, Auto Shoot, Triggerbot and Shoot Murderer; TP Shoot and the Rage type fire directly.",
		Multi = false,
